CREATE TABLE "Product" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"sku" TEXT,"unit" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'unit',"stockMilli" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 CHECK("stockMilli">=0),"pricePaise" INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK("pricePaise">0),"createdAt" DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" DATETIME NOT NULL);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "Product_name_key" ON "Product"("name");
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "Product_sku_key" ON "Product"("sku");
CREATE TABLE "Supplier" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"phone" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"createdAt" DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE TABLE "SupplierInvoice" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"supplierId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "Supplier"("id"),"reference" TEXT NOT NULL,"totalPaise" INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK("totalPaise">0),"taxPaise" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 CHECK("taxPaise">=0),"dueOn" TEXT NOT NULL,"occurredOn" TEXT NOT NULL,"lines" TEXT NOT NULL,"key" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "SupplierInvoice_key_key" ON "SupplierInvoice"("key");
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "SupplierInvoice_supplierId_reference_key" ON "SupplierInvoice"("supplierId","reference");
CREATE INDEX "SupplierInvoice_dueOn_idx" ON "SupplierInvoice"("dueOn");
CREATE TABLE "SupplierPayment" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"supplierId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "Supplier"("id"),"amountPaise" INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK("amountPaise">0),"occurredOn" TEXT NOT NULL,"key" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "SupplierPayment_key_key" ON "SupplierPayment"("key");
CREATE TABLE "InventoryMovement" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"productId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "Product"("id"),"deltaMilli" INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK("deltaMilli"!=0),"reason" TEXT NOT NULL,"reference" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE INDEX "InventoryMovement_productId_idx" ON "InventoryMovement"("productId");
CREATE TABLE "Sale" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"customerId" TEXT REFERENCES "Customer"("id"),"totalPaise" INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK("totalPaise">0),"mode" TEXT NOT NULL CHECK("mode" IN ('cash','credit')),"entryId" TEXT REFERENCES "Entry"("id"),"lines" TEXT NOT NULL,"key" TEXT NOT NULL,"occurredOn" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "Sale_entryId_key" ON "Sale"("entryId");
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "Sale_key_key" ON "Sale"("key");
CREATE TABLE "CashRecord" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"kind" TEXT NOT NULL CHECK("kind" IN ('opening','receipt','expense')),"amountPaise" INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK("amountPaise">=0),"occurredOn" TEXT NOT NULL,"key" TEXT NOT NULL,"note" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"createdAt" DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "CashRecord_key_key" ON "CashRecord"("key");
CREATE TABLE "BusinessOperation" ("key" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"fingerprint" TEXT NOT NULL,"result" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE TRIGGER "SupplierInvoice_immutable_update" BEFORE UPDATE ON "SupplierInvoice" BEGIN SELECT RAISE(ABORT, 'Business records are append-only'); END;
CREATE TRIGGER "SupplierInvoice_immutable_delete" BEFORE DELETE ON "SupplierInvoice" BEGIN SELECT RAISE(ABORT, 'Business records are append-only'); END;
CREATE TRIGGER "SupplierPayment_immutable_update" BEFORE UPDATE ON "SupplierPayment" BEGIN SELECT RAISE(ABORT, 'Business records are append-only'); END;
CREATE TRIGGER "SupplierPayment_immutable_delete" BEFORE DELETE ON "SupplierPayment" BEGIN SELECT RAISE(ABORT, 'Business records are append-only'); END;
CREATE TRIGGER "InventoryMovement_immutable_update" BEFORE UPDATE ON "InventoryMovement" BEGIN SELECT RAISE(ABORT, 'Business records are append-only'); END;
CREATE TRIGGER "InventoryMovement_immutable_delete" BEFORE DELETE ON "InventoryMovement" BEGIN SELECT RAISE(ABORT, 'Business records are append-only'); END;
CREATE TRIGGER "Sale_immutable_update" BEFORE UPDATE ON "Sale" BEGIN SELECT RAISE(ABORT, 'Business records are append-only'); END;
CREATE TRIGGER "Sale_immutable_delete" BEFORE DELETE ON "Sale" BEGIN SELECT RAISE(ABORT, 'Business records are append-only'); END;
CREATE TRIGGER "CashRecord_immutable_update" BEFORE UPDATE ON "CashRecord" BEGIN SELECT RAISE(ABORT, 'Business records are append-only'); END;
CREATE TRIGGER "CashRecord_immutable_delete" BEFORE DELETE ON "CashRecord" BEGIN SELECT RAISE(ABORT, 'Business records are append-only'); END;
CREATE TRIGGER "BusinessOperation_immutable_update" BEFORE UPDATE ON "BusinessOperation" BEGIN SELECT RAISE(ABORT, 'Business records are append-only'); END;
CREATE TRIGGER "BusinessOperation_immutable_delete" BEFORE DELETE ON "BusinessOperation" BEGIN SELECT RAISE(ABORT, 'Business records are append-only'); END;
